                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.12151A/207: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-03-26T17:00:00-06:00">March 26, 1930—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7:11 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>65. Your telegrams number 78, March 20, 5 p.m., and number 83, March 25, 6 p.m.
                    Note was delivered to Mexican Foreign Office today. Copy will be forwarded by
                    next pouch.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
